<title>MALAYSIA: Mun Loong six-month net up 109.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Mun Loong six-month net up 109.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept. 30, 1996</p>
<p>				(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 0.69	  vs	loss   7.03</p>
<p>    Shr (cents) profit     0.02	  vs	loss  22.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 132.50	  vs	     134.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   4.57	  vs	loss   5.69</p>
<p>    Minorities less	  1.74	  vs		 0.69</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Mun Loong Bhd. It is involved in retailing and construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
